<title>GERMANY: Schwarz Pharma details 96 profits.</title>
<headline>Schwarz Pharma details 96 profits.</headline>
<dateline>MONHEIM, Germany 1996-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Calendar 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group sales				  1,195   up 17.5 pct</p>
<p>    Group domestic sales		     584.2   up  9.4 pct</p>
<p>    Group foreign sales			610.8   up 26 pct</p>
<p>    Sales in U.S.				266.2   up 44 pct</p>
<p>    Group net profit			   103.8   vs 90.8</p>
<p>    Group earnings per share (DVFA)	4.49    vs 3.74 marks</p>
<p>    Group cash flow			    185.6   vs 146.8</p>
<p>    Group return on sales		    8.7     vs 8.9 pct</p>
<p>    Group return on capital		  24.8    vs 26.2 pct</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German drugs group is Schwarz Pharma AG. The group had released some of its sales data in January. At that time it had also forecast that its 1997 group sales would climb by six to eight percent, with profits growing more strongly than that.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
